2026-07-27T11:08:34.7622379Z i /tmp/Rtmpcqigo4/duckdb
2026-07-27T11:08:34.7622724Z This is removed when the R session ends.
2026-07-27T11:08:34.7623121Z * Extensions are re-downloaded each session.
2026-07-27T11:08:34.7623470Z * Secrets are lost.
2026-07-27T11:08:34.7624023Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = TRUE) (or create ~/.duckdb) to keep them (suitable for most users).
2026-07-27T11:08:34.7624811Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = FALSE) to accept the temporary directory (and silence this message).
2026-07-27T11:08:34.7625738Z i See ?duckdb_storage for details and alternatives.
